6. Execution Constraints (Hard Boundaries)

C1 — No New Systems

If a feature requires a new subsystem → it must be merged into an existing one


---

C2 — No Background Autonomy Loops

No infinite ingestion loops without external trigger

Allowed triggers:

GitHub Actions schedule

Supabase edge function trigger

manual invocation



---

C3 — No Direct Memory Writes

All external data must pass:
ERIS → ATHENA → staging → approval


---

C4 — Deterministic Output Required

Every ingestion run must produce:

input_hash
processing_path
decision_trace
final_state


